d separately in actual Lato Black900 for headline/date/category/numbers and small one-line32px MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF, and Georgia for body/sources; ALL authored text>=30px at1080x1920, body>=32headline>=48; allnewsinside x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. Render background only. Composition should feel specific to a cloud software workplace and sober employment news, not finance trading screens.",
